Alpha Centauri — public showcase copy
=====================================

Cut on 2026-09-23 from the working repository, at a pinned revision.

Every measured number in README.md and docs/EVIDENCE.md was produced by running
that revision's own code against that revision's own geometry, on 2026-09-23,
from a clean export. The evidence files each carry a timestamp:
docs/evidence/sim_results.json records when the crawl ran, and
docs/evidence/provenance.json records when the model was exported from the CAD.

This repository has no git history before its first commit, and carries no
revision id from the working repository, by design: it is a standalone
publication, not a mirror. What anchors the numbers to the code is the export
snapshot in docs/evidence/provenance.json — 20 STEP hashes plus every constant
the exporter used — not a commit id that resolves to nothing a reader can reach.

Removed for publication, and why: see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
How to reproduce the numbers: see BUILD.md and docs/EVIDENCE.md.
